      <slug></slug>
      <title>Porting a Java VM to a Hardware Accelerator</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>Free Java</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;We&amp;#39;d like to present a project porting a Java Virtual Machine to a hardware Java accelerator.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Specifically, we are trying to port JamVM to AVR32&amp;#39;s Java Extension Module. We&amp;#39;ll briefly explain how hardware Java accelerators work, give motivation for our choice of a specific JVM and CPU platform, describe specifics of this port, its current state and future plans.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </description>
      <persons>
          <person id="1461">Guennadi Liakhovetski</person>
      </persons>
      <links></links>
      <video></video>
      <end></end>
  </event>